<title>UK: Alcatel Alstholm sets 1.5 billion Ffr bond.</title>
<headline>Alcatel Alstholm sets 1.5 billion Ffr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALCATEL ALSTHOLM</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    12.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.798   PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.173    SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA-   LISTING    PARIS     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
